{"vfs": [{"id": "vfS", "headword": "वृश्", "headword_slp1": "vfS", "fold": "vfs", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "वृश् vt. 4P (pres. वृश्यति) To choose, to select.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "vfz", "headword": "वृष्", "headword_slp1": "vfz", "fold": "vfs", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "वृष् (I) vt. or vi. 1P (pp. वृष्ट; pres. वर्षति) 1. To rain, (either used impersonally or with such words as इंद्र, मेघ, पर्जन्य, देव as the subject), मेघा वर्षंतु गर्जंतु मूंचंत्वशनिमेव वा Mrich.v., or उन्नमति नमति वर्षंति गर्जंति मेघः करोति तिमिरौघम् ibid, or गर्ज वा वर्ष वा शक्र मुंच वा शतशोऽशनिम् ibid; 2. to shower down, to pour down, e.g. पुष्पवृष्टिमवर्षन्; 3. to give, to bestow; 4. to be capable of generating; 5. to have supreme power.With अभि-, 1. to shower, to rain; 2. to give, to bestow.With प्र-, to rain, to shower, प्रवर्षंति प्रेयसि चंद्रिकाभिश्चकोरचंचूचुलुकां प्रतीन्दुः Na.xxii.41.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "वृष् (II) vi. 10Ā (pres. वर्षयते) 1. To be powerful; 2. to have the power of generation.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "vfsa": [{"id": "vfSa", "headword": "वृश", "headword_slp1": "vfSa", "fold": "vfsa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "वृश (I) m. A rat.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "वृश (II) n. Ginger.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["वृशः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vfSaH"]}, {"id": "vfza", "headword": "वृष", "headword_slp1": "vfza", "fold": "vfsa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "वृष (I) m. 1. A bull, कैलासगौरं वृषमारुरुक्षोः R.ii.35, K.S.v.80, Megh.i.52; 2. the sign Taurus of the zodiac; 3. an epithet of the god of love; 4. a man of one of the four classes (in erotic works); 5. a rat; 6. an enemy, an adversary; 7. justice, morality; 8. merit, virtue; 9. a strong man; 10. (generally at the end of a compound) anything the best of its kind; 11. an epithet of Karṇa; 12. of Viṣṇu.", "gloss_la